{"parse": {"title": "WFS-03", "pageid": 64958, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/WFS-02\" title=\"WFS-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">WFS-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/WFS-04\" title=\"WFS-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">WFS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.BB.91.E7.94.B2.E8.99.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"黑甲虫\">黑甲虫</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 黑甲虫</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Blackened Beetles</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>像<span class=\"color-value\"></span>虫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>才<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>接<span class=\"color-value\"></span>近<span class=\"color-value\"></span>死<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191503</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>3月13日0:04，天气阴。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风雨暂歇，午夜的月光给地平线笼上了一层暗沉的蓝紫色，看起来就像一道淤伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩从衣柜里钻了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>你不是爸爸。你是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>小鬼，你躲在衣柜里做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>和爸爸玩捉迷藏的游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>嘿，杰克。有人说过你的眼睛很像一种动物吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>知道吗？你拥有的这双眼睛会令很多人和你签约合作，让你在他们的电影作品里出镜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>比如我，我就特别想邀请你出演我最新的电影！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>但如果我跟你去拍电影，爸爸回来找不到我怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你爸爸？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她回忆起了那张照片，随后发出了惊喜的疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>——斯塔尔先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>你认识爸爸？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你知道吗？你爸爸是传闻的主角……所有的人都想找到他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>这背后一定有一段值得挖掘的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>——我要找到爸爸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你确实得找到你的爸爸，他是你的监护人——我可不想被控告违反童工法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>真的吗？那好……只要能找到爸爸，我就做你的演员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>那就一言为定了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiaoshulin_zao\"><img alt=\"jiaoshulin_zao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/600px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/900px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/1200px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树木的阴影自高处投下，笼罩着二人的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>老板竟然一整晚都没回来……好吧，我还贴心地给他留了个便条——至于他能不能看见，那就不关我的事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将手电筒照向老柏树阴暗缠结的树干。魔精的眼睛一闪，旋即隐入黑色巢穴之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>跟紧我，杰克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看向杰克，此时的杰克正低头望着地面，专注地瞧着泥地上干瘪得如一块灰色小圆饼的黑甲虫尸体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>金蜜儿小姐，请问为什么虫子在死去的时候身体会变成一个空壳呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>因为它们身体内的有机质都被细菌霉菌分解了，只剩下无机外壳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>是不是因为它们缺少灵魂？灵魂不见了，所以它们的身体才会变成空洞？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>灵魂……？当然不是，它们腐烂只有一个原因，那就是它们死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>爸爸经常念给我听的黑暗先生的诗集里有很多这样的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我建议你少听这些东西，虽然我并不排斥文艺片，但这个世界上有太多无病呻吟的故事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>很多人把“灵魂”与“死亡”理解为某种时尚风潮，好像只要讨论这个问题，立刻就能拿下大奖了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>而文艺片正是其中的重灾区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>这些是不好的故事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>虽然我不认为那是一个好故事，但不可否认烂片也有它的用处——它至少提供了很多工作岗位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>人总是得先填饱肚子，我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿走上一条延伸至森林深处的小径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周围的锯草中密布着毛细血管般的细狭水洼，她走近一看，原来是由雨水积在车轮碾过留下的坑洼形成的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>跟着车轮的痕迹走，或许能找到斯塔尔先生的车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>不过按照恐怖电影常用的套路，车里应该空无一人，或者……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑茫茫的森林深处闪过一道微弱的黄色光亮，扫过她的眼睛，随后又消失不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闻到一股难闻的柏油似的化学气味，像是石油，甜腻但令人恶心。沥青、硫磺的分子渗透进她的头发、妆容和鼻腔后面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……是汽油。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>引擎的声响远远传来，并疾速逼近。金蜜儿闻声扭头，只见一辆黄色的卡玛洛汽车从侧边冲出，七扭八歪地朝她和杰克撞过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306021.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306021.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>小心！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车子擦过二人的身侧，发出凄厉的尖叫，随后是一声巨大的声响，金蜜儿听见汽车撞到树上、引擎熄火的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>驾驶座上没有人？不会吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车门“砰”的一声自动打开，热气扑面而来，从里面窜出了几只魔精。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们因为被烟雾蒙住了视线而惊慌地到处乱窜，领头的那只黑黄相间的魔精让金蜜儿颇有几分熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>魔精……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿看向那辆被撞成废铁、宛如古怪雕塑的汽车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前挡风玻璃上绑着一面旗帜，旗帜上的图案是斯塔尔家的盾形纹章，下面还有一句题词“生活在希望中”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……真是讽刺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>爸爸他不在车里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>金蜜儿小姐，现在我们是不是只要继续向前走……就可以见到爸爸了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……现在还不能确定。但如果我们想要把这个疑问转变成确切的答案，就要一直向前走才行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>好，我想想找到爸爸时应该对他说些什么……“找到你了，爸爸”还是“爸爸你看，我赢了”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>等一下，那边好像有什么——嘘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当金蜜儿停下的时候，杰克也安静下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰克：</div><div>……是爸爸吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306021.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306021.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不确定自己到底在盯着什么，只循着手电筒的光柱发现了一个深深的坑穴，里面堆着一团焦黑的物体，混杂着污损潮湿的雨和血腥味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闻到一股腐坏的烧焦气味，这感觉遥远却又熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑甲虫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑甲虫倒在她面前的空地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我的天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两具焦黑如炭的尸骸拥抱在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着她又看见一段如烧焦的粗木棍般突起的腕骨，她的目光审视着它，直到在某一处彻底停了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306022.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-306022.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306022.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306022.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-306022.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306022.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-306022.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306022.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>这是……斯塔尔先生的腕表！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的胸口一阵阵紧缩，浑身血液冰冷得有如脚下的水流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306021.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306021.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>这是他的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿望着那两具尸骨，感觉他们正在死死盯着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>斯塔尔先生旁边的那个尸体，看起来是个小孩……难道是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>不，怎么可能！杰克明明就在这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>那这个和斯塔尔先生死在一起的小孩是谁？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>救救我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306021.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306021.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-306021.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306021.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……是他吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiaoshulin_zao\"><img alt=\"jiaoshulin_zao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/600px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/900px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/1200px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果死在这里的是“杰克·斯塔尔”本人，那么她在夜枭旅馆的阁楼上见到的“杰克”又是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……杰克？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人回应。金蜜儿赶忙扭头，发现自己的身侧竟空无一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处传来轰轰的雷声，随后大片湿漉漉的雨滴沉重地往下落，几乎盖过了金蜜儿背后的脚步声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的后脑勺左侧遭到重重一击，眼前一黑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306019.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306019.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-306019.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306019.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>唔……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "WFS-03"}}